1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:08,500
PayPilot AI is an intelligent purchasing platform combining natural-language recommendations with authoritative catalog grounding and secure PayPal payments.

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Users explore a live merchant storefront with server-validated pricing and real-time inventory.

3
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:23,500
Searching filters the catalog instantly, and adding an item updates the order total in the navigation bar.

4
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Instead of manual comparisons, buyers consult our AI assistant with natural-language requirements.

5
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:45,500
The assistant evaluates the prompt against live warehouse stock, verifying budget constraints and computing risk scores.

6
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Behind the scenes, PayPilot's Gemini Provider layer enforces robust multi-model resilience.

7
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:00,500
Configured with primary and fallback models, it handles upstream capacity limits with bounded timeouts and error sanitization.

8
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:09,000
Opening the purchase order drawer reveals itemized totals with live quantity recalculation.

9
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:17,500
Containerized PayPal Smart Buttons enable one-click payment, protected by client-generated idempotency keys.

10
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:26,000
Every initiated and captured order is immutably recorded in the transaction ledger.

11
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:34,500
We can review PayPal order and capture references, and download an official itemized PDF receipt.

12
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:46,000
Our payment architecture guarantees complete settlement integrity: atomic inventory ledger deductions, capture reconciliation on network drops, and tamper-proof PDF generation.

13
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:51,500
PayPilot AI: Shop smarter, decide better, and pay securely. Engineered for modern enterprise commerce.

